38
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,560
Don't worry,

39
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,360
Ouyang Zi will definitely make the pill.

40
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:00,880
Wrong...

41
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,800
Wrong !

42
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,040
It's wrong...

43
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,160
Even that is wrong...

44
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:11,120
Ancestor.

45
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:12,520
It's wrong !

46
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:22,920
It's all wrong !

47
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,480
Peak grade 5...

48
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,040
That's not enough.

49
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,480
If it takes too long to make the pill,

50
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:31,040
Wan'er's body might not hold on for long enough.

51
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:33,090
Don't disturb me

52
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,720
