78
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,160
Can I see it ?

79
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:33,280
Don't wait for the future love,

80
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,200
We'll travel on the star compass

81
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:31,480
