86
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,520
Senior,

87
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:48,300
Ask the palm lines of time...

88
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,440
I'd like to go to the Four Sect Alliance

89
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:46,560
