90
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,240
and also

91
00:05:49,210 --> 00:05:55,360
Sincerely entrust your love, don't waste time.

92
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,520
that old street you lived in.

93
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:53,200
Sure.

94
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:59,280
I promised in my dreams

95
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:03,080
