96
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:09,440
In the blink of an eye, I will change the world.

97
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:13,840
These nights of longing in the past...

98
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,000
Wan'er

99
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:15,080
When you're better,

100
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:17,520
Deep in my heart,

101
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:17,000
