106
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:28,720
We will overcome our doomed fate.

107
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:32,080
The night won't last forever.

108
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:34,080
Do you believe in

109
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:38,520
