127
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:05,080
I'm sure it will give her enough time to form her Nascent Soul.

128
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:15,560
It's working.

129
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,400
Condense !

130
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,920
It's coming...

131
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:23,560
