132
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,400
Li Muwan's
Nascent Soul

133
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,520
Break !

134
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:50,240
These dozens of restrictions I placed over the past 3 years

135
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:54,000
